    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42083" root="وطد" body-key="w">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَاطِدٌ</span></b>  <i>Constant, firm, steady, steadfast, fast,
settled,</i> or <i>established;</i> as also, by transposition,
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَادٍ</span> [q. v. in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طدو</span>]. (S, L.) See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَطِيدٌ</span>,
and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُتَوَاطدٌ</span>, and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُوَطَّدٌ</span>.

